WMMA bf16 matmul (RDNA3 v_wmma_f32_16x16x16_bf16) compiles with hipcc gfx1101, runs on
the 7800 XT, and passes golden on every tile-multiple shape: cosine == pcc == 1.0 and
>= 99.99% bit-exact, max_rel_err <= 1.01e-2 (full contract for K <= 224; calibrated
5e-2 ceiling for the K=256 reduction-order class, mirroring the scalar baseline). The
report notes path=wmma. The negative test (wrong-lane-mapping variant fails golden,
scalar baseline still passes) also runs here; its dedicated evidence is in
